reason={
'afa7dae7':('Nano-Silber, GK/LK','p32 Nano is bold eA. The whole silver/polyolefin migration and antimicrobial comparison is a declared additional SkillPilot acquisition scope in both views; it is not whole official credit.','The profile distinguishes primary size, aggregation and dissolved silver. 10^6 to 2×10^4 is 98% reduction; nondetection is a threshold statement. The aged comparison lacks the aged neat-polymer control and cannot establish a silver-specific ageing cause. Benefit does not establish food or environmental safety.'),
'73cbd4d8':('Conductive polymer mechanism, GK/LK','p30 benzene resonance is eA; p32 polymer structure/function is a partial context. Neither states the full conjugated-polymer/doping/transport unit as a universal course duty. Own scope is explicit.','Conjugation alone does not guarantee metallic conductivity. Oxidative doping/counterions, mobile carriers, disorder and contacts are distinguished. 10^-3 to 10^4 gives a factor 10^7; interruption by sp3 links is compatible with reduced transport without identifying a unique cause. The proposed control conditions are chemically relevant.'),
'f947cd04':('Polyurethane polyaddition, LK','p28/31/32 provide reaction and macromolecule contexts, not full urethane mechanism, equivalence and water-side-reaction credit. The existing LK theory unit remains an explicit own extension.','Alcohol O attacks the electrophilic isocyanate carbon; formal addition/proton transfer gives urethane without water elimination. A concerted or catalysed proton-transfer representation is allowed. Functionality and conversion govern branching/networking. A full water-to-urea path consumes two NCO groups per H2O: 2 mmol H2O consumes 4 mmol NCO and releases 2 mmol CO2, not evidence of network quality.'),
'd61ce84f':('Second aromatic substitution, LK','p30 specifies eA first substitution; p28 inductive effects are partial context. Neither automatically entails whole second-substitution directing chemistry.','Sigma-complex stabilization explains neutral donor o/p and nitro meta preference, not exclusive products. Protonated aniline loses the donating lone pair and is deactivating/meta-directing in the stated idealised model. This is not a quantitative prediction of real mixed-protonation nitration products.'),
'f57d53b0':('Viscose and cellulose derivatives, LK','p30–32 functional-group/natural-product/polymer contexts do not establish a whole viscose/acetate process or fibre-comparison duty. Explicit own LK scope is appropriate; current E0/G0 remains.','Temporary xanthate followed by regeneration is distinguished from permanent acetate esters; the cellulose backbone persists. The acetate reaction is balanced and no rubber identity is introduced. DS1 and DS2.5 leave mean 2 and 0.5 free OH per repeat, respectively. Given uptake values support the bounded comparison, not a universal causal material ranking or actual manufacture.'),
'e47b22ec':('Biopolymer degradation, LK','p31–32 recycling and eA ecological/economic discussion provide context, not the entire supplied PLA/cellulose mechanistic and carbon-balance investigation.','Water-dependent PLA chain scission differs from biological mineralisation. Sterile hydrolysis and enzyme-sensitive glycosidic cleavage do not imply complete CO2 conversion. 30% or 60% polymer carbon as CO2 is partial mineralisation; residual carbon, blanks and environmental conditions remain relevant. Cold-water transfer is not warranted from warm treatment.'),
'3dbd84de':('Sigma-complex mechanism, LK','p30 eA first substitution supplies direct partial context. The whole electron-pair, charge, octet and proton-transfer profile remains own acquisition; no actual nitration is certified.','The attacked ring carbon becomes sp3; the sigma complex temporarily lacks cyclic aromatic delocalisation. Base-to-H and C–H-to-ring arrows restore aromaticity. For nitronium attack a N=O pair shifts to O so nitrogen retains an octet; ring deprotonation transfers H+, not hydride. The stated net charge balances are coherent.'),
'b7b5df21':('Friedel–Crafts planning, LK','p30 first substitution and p31 eA route planning do not entail full Friedel–Crafts chemistry. Own planning scope does not assert practical synthesis or yield; E0/G0 remains.','Carbocation rearrangement and polyalkylation are distinguished from acylium acylation. Acylation then the separately supplied reduction retains all side-chain carbons for propyl/butyl targets. Strong substrate deactivation and AlCl3 complexation limit naive catalyst/substrate generalisations. The supplied ratio is condition-specific and cannot be copied to altered conditions.'),
'4b9810b0':('Inductive/resonance acidity and basicity, LK','p21/22 acid–base/pK, p28 induction and p30 eA benzene resonance are partial contexts. The whole phenol/alcohol and amine comparison remains explicit own LK acquisition.','Aqueous pKa and conjugate-acid comparisons use a specified medium/site. Phenoxide stabilization and aniline lone-pair delocalisation explain the comparisons; induction decreases with saturated-chain distance and is not a pi bridge. The existing ca216 whole teaching unit supplies genuine conjugate-base/acid-stability acquisition required before this dependent goal.'),
'e96771d3':('Aromatic uses and health, LK','General safety and aromatic reaction contexts do not establish full benzene/IARC exposure/substitution evaluation. Own criteria-based theory scope is explicit.','The dated IARC-120/2018 case distinguishes carcinogenic hazard classification from individual probability and from actual workplace permission. Closed-feedstock and open-cleaning scenarios cannot be ranked solely by aromaticity; exposure and alternatives matter. No invented toxicity is assigned to every ring-containing material. Publisher primary page checked; its online Evaluation is labelled updated September2019, not claimed as an authenticated 2018 PDF byte stream.'),
'14f1fe97':('Conductive polymers versus metals, LK','p30/32 structure/function contexts do not entail the whole resistance/mass/ageing comparison. Own LK acquisition retains conditional evaluation.','R=L/(sigma A) and mass=rho LA use equal geometry. The profile resistance thresholds distinguish sensor use from low-resistance power use. Passing an initial threshold is not durability; combined humidity/bending does not isolate either cause. No universal polymer-over-metal ranking is justified.'),
'6eba90b5':('Polymer processing, LK','p30/32 polymer function/use are partial contexts; the four process and temperature/network cases are explicit own LK acquisition.','Melt injection, warm-sheet thermoforming, calendering and extrusion are linked to shape and material behaviour. A dense crosslinked network cannot simply be remelted; a precursor-then-crosslink proposal is conditional on kinetics and shape retention. Given processing/decomposition windows do not confer machine or practical operating clearance.'),
'059acb11':('Half-equivalence pK, LK','p23 bold eA includes characteristic points and experimental half-equivalence determination. Own data/model goal and both complete G6 cases are preserved; paper calculations do not satisfy the separate practical obligation. E0/G0 remains.','C1: initial2 mmol HA, half equivalence at10 mL gives equal HA/A and pKa4.80 under the stated ideal-buffer approximation; 5 mL gives ratio1/3 and pH4.32288. C2: initial1 mmol B, half point5 mL gives pKa(BH+)9.20 and pKb4.80 at pKw14. Weak conjugate-pair conditions are required; a strong-acid mixture is not an eligible shortcut.'),
'ca216bc6':('Real acidity foundation, new LK target','p21/22,28,30 are bounded contexts, not whole official credit. One existing ordinary teacher is added only to NI-LK and explicitly declared an own acquisition foundation.','The complete goal/P teaches alcohol versus carboxylic-acid acidity through conjugate-base charge/resonance and inductive effects. Carboxylate equivalent resonance forms preserve total charge and bonds; chloro substitution comparison uses distance-dependent induction. These are the actual concepts needed by 4b981, so adding this teacher has a scientific basis independent of reducing a role count.')}
